      "type": "Person",
      "name": "vladstudio",
      "preferredUsername": "vladstudio",
      "summary": "<p dir=\"auto\">In 1998 I started designing user interfaces for web sites and software apps. However, whenever I had some free time, I created digital pictures, to express myself and improve my Photoshop skills.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">In 2003 I started Vladstudio website as a way to share my pictures in the form of desktop wallpapers.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Today, I am dedicated to turning Vladstudio into my full time job. I love what I do, and I am happy that many people around the world love it, too!</p>\n",
